sequenceDiagram
    participant OSS as Live OSS feeds
    participant ETL as ETL pipeline
    participant Det as Anomaly detector
    participant RCA as Agentic RCA
    participant Ops as NOC / operators
    participant Mail as Email reports
    participant Dash as Live dashboard

    loop Continuous ingest
        OSS->>ETL: Counters / KPIs / node health
        ETL->>Det: Cleaned time-series features
        Det->>Det: Seasonality & holiday-aware scoring
        alt Anomaly scored
            Det->>RCA: Candidate incident
            RCA->>RCA: Correlate signals / propose cause
            RCA->>Mail: Structured alert
            RCA->>Dash: Incident card
            Dash-->>Ops: Investigate & acknowledge
            Ops-->>Det: Feedback loop
        end
    end
